  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-squares",
      "text": "[**English**](README.md) | [中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\nAn **all-in-one workspace plugin** for DSH (DeepSeek Harness): it adds a global\n「Square」panel to the Web GUI sidebar that manages **Skills / Experts / Connectors (MCP) / Plugins**\nin a single place. **Web (`dsh web`) and Desktop (DeepSeek Harness.app) share the same code and build output.**"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-squares",
      "text": "Sidebar → 「Square」panel: the four tabs show the Square (official/community catalog) by default; the\n「My Experts / My Skills / My MCP / My Plugins」items in the top-right open sub-pages to manage local\ncontent, and 「Back to Square」at the top of the sub-page returns to the Square."
    },
    {
      "section": "1. Installation",
      "text": "Published on npm and GitHub:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-squares            # install from npm\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:ai-tool-labs/dsh-squares   # or from GitHub"
    },
    {
      "section": "Restart harness after installing to take effect (Desktop: restart the App; Web: restart dsh web)",
      "text": "```\n\nA 「Square」entry then appears in the sidebar; click it to open the panel."
    },
    {
      "section": "2. Screenshots",
      "text": "The **Square** panel as it appears in the Web GUI sidebar:"
    },
    {
      "section": "3. Development",
